Shut up! Oh, nice!

252
00:13:31,960 --> 00:13:34,740
The genius who cancels his credit card tells his daughter to shut up!

253
00:13:34,840 --> 00:13:39,340
I did what I had to do, and I tell you, staying here is a lot better than borrowing

