I'm worried, too.

317
00:16:50,360 --> 00:16:52,040
Not half as much as I am.

318
00:16:55,700 --> 00:16:57,560
You've always been there for me.

319
00:16:58,920 --> 00:17:02,360
And I know this has been a big change for all of us.

320
00:17:02,360 --> 00:17:06,780
And I worry about not being here for you because, well, you're the youngest.

321
00:17:07,820 --> 00:17:11,640
And I worry about not being here for Carol because she's a girl and she needs her

322
