323
00:17:16,180 --> 00:17:17,480
blowing something up.

324
00:17:18,600 --> 00:17:22,260
And believe me, I worry about leaving your father here to cope with all you

325
00:17:22,260 --> 00:17:26,140
monsters. You shouldn't worry so much, Mom.

326
00:17:26,360 --> 00:17:27,540
You'll make yourself great.

327
